<!-- TEMP NOETS -->
Design Rules:
In root: tailwindcss for layout
Component when: has a clear rule 
CSS in component: things that belong to the component, not the parent
Tailwind -> layout + short styles
Native CSS -> component spesific + clear redundent styles
(
    Tailwind = contextual composition/layout
    Component CSS = component appearance + intrinsic internal layout
    Components = semantic/visual/behavioral units
    Tokens = shared design decisions
    Parent = external geometry/context
    Component = internal geometry/appearance
)

